# Changelog

## [1.0.0] - 2026-10-10

### Added

- Initial public release of the VS Code extension.
- Core extension functionality.
- Support for compatible VS Code-based editors like Hugo.

## [1.0.1] - 2026-10-11

### Changed

- Simpler README aimed at the extension page rather than the repository.

## [1.0.2] - 2026-10-11

### Changed

- Listed under the Visualization category, alongside Other.
